.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt LSMP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm lsmp
.Nd list the Mach ports of a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl vl
.Op Fl j Ar file
.Fl a | Fl p Ar pid
.Nm
.Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lists the Mach ports a process holds.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl a
List every process.
.It Fl p Ar pid
List this process.
.It Fl v
Print more detail, with voucher details.
.It Fl l
Print as
.Fl v
does, with longer voucher details.
.It Fl j Ar file
Also write the result to this file as JSON.
.It Fl h
Print usage.
.El
